## 12. SOC Analyst Investigation Checklist

Use this checklist when reviewing Windows events.

- [ ] Identify the log name and provider.
- [ ] Check the Event ID and timestamp.
- [ ] Read the General and Details views.
- [ ] Identify relevant users and computers.
- [ ] Check IP addresses and process information when available.
- [ ] Review surrounding events.
- [ ] Correlate related activity.
- [ ] Build an investigation timeline.
- [ ] Separate confirmed facts from assumptions.
- [ ] Document evidence, findings, and recommended next steps.

