## 13. Key Terms

| Term | Meaning |
|---|---|
| **Event ID** | Numeric identifier for an event type. |
| **Provider / Source** | Component that generated the event. |
| **Channel** | Log where events are stored. |
| **Audit Policy** | Controls which security activities Windows records. |
| **EVTX** | Native Windows Event Log file format. |
| **SIEM** | Platform that collects and correlates logs from multiple systems. |
| **Logon Type** | Identifies the method used to access a Windows system. |
| **Event Correlation** | Connecting related events to understand an activity or incident. |

